summary:
  The popup asks for the window again when the listener clicks away from it.

history:
  An opened popup that finds its face away asks for the window, once, as
  it gets the keyboard. Asked again as it loses it, a pinned popup would
  call the window back over whatever the listener had just clicked on.

target:
  package/contents/ui/PopupFace.qml

find:
          if (activeFocus && away) house.requestActivate();

replace:
          if (away) house.requestActivate();

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_popupface.qml::test_the_window_is_asked_forward_as_the_popup_gets_the_keyboard_and_not_as_it_loses_it.
